  "releaseNotes": "[Fix] Namespace::importedMember and getNamesOfMember stop at PackageImport cycles instead of overflowing the stack; fixes #490\n          [Fix] ReplyAction::input contains the replyValue pins; fixes #491\n          [Fix] ContainerList keeps an element owned while another list of its container holds it, moves it between containers and maintains containment through IList; fixes #492\n          [Fix] Property::opposite is null instead of throwing for a property that is not a member end of its association, and uses the owning association; fixes #495\n          [Fix] Classifier::directlyUsedInterfaces follows the specification text: Usages from the Classifier to Interfaces; fixes #497\n          [Fix] IClassifier.General of Class and its subtypes returns every parent instead of forwarding to superClass; fixes #494",
